        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "This section applies to the appointment under section 489(4) of an auditor or auditors of a public company— (a) which is also a public interest entity; and (b) which does not have an audit committee": a scope with no "only" (fork F14)

