    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the directors must carry out a selection procedure in accordance with Article 16(3) of the Audit Regulation, from which their proposed auditor or auditors must be drawn" (a bare must not done: fork F4)

§§ `s 489C Restriction on appointment of auditor of public company which is a public interest entity`

-- src:6846 | (1) A person who has been, or will have been, auditor of a public company which is a public interest entity for every financial year comprised in the maximum engagement period (see section 494ZA) may not be appointed as auditor of the company for any financial year which begins within the period of 4 years beginning with the day after the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period.
